          "explanation": "Rand says the dictionary meaning is simply 'concern with one's own interests,' and that this concept carries no moral verdict by itself. Ordinary speech packs in the image of a brute who exploits people, which she calls a package deal. The options about acting on feelings or using people describe exactly the brute she says is NOT practicing genuine self-interest. Refusing all help is also not her view; generosity can be consistent with her ethics.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">DEFINING THE WORD</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Dictionary sense vs. popular image</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Which one does Rand defend?</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"580\" r=\"120\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OWN</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">INTERESTS</text><circle cx=\"760\" cy=\"580\" r=\"120\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">BRUTE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Pick the meaning she says is neutral</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Test your understanding of the title"
          }
