          "explanation": "'Qua' means 'as,' so the standard is survival as a human being: living by reason and productive effort over a lifetime. Rand explicitly rejects mere survival by any means and acting for the range of the moment, which is why the con artist fails her test. The species option is wrong because her standard is each individual's own life. The instinct option is wrong because she argues humans lack an automatic survival code and must think.",
