            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">JUDGE IT YOURSELF</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">A six-step debate drill</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1. Rand in three lines</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"280\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"332\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2. Nozick in one line</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"390\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"442\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3. Defenders in one line</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"500\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"552\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">4. Score the exchange</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"610\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"662\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">5. Test a hard case</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"720\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"772\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">6. Verdict, labeled as opinion</text></svg>",
